        <activityName xml:lang="en">Malusil, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Malusil, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of malusil. Quite a large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
UUID: 9687d96e-3924-39d8-9f3d-5bafb50ee4ce
Raw materials, machineries and energy consumption for production, estimated emissions to air from production and infrastructure of the site (approximation). No water emissions.
Location: Data are used here as European average.
Technology: Data approximated with data from lime mining, crushing and milling.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9687d96e-3924-39d8-9f3d-5bafb50ee4ce.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
